---
import Button from './Button.astro';
---

<section class="min-h-[90vh] flex items-center border-b-2 border-black dark:border-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-heading font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
        Hi, I'm <span class="text-accent">Bayu Rizky</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-body mb-8 max-w-2xl">
        Backend Engineer & Systems Architect building scalable, high-performance systems. Specializing in Node.js, Go, and AI/LLM integration.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <Button href="/#projects" variant="primary">View Projects</Button>
        <Button href="/contact" variant="secondary">Get in Touch</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 border-b-2 border-black dark:border-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-8">About Me</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="font-body text-lg">
          I am a Backend Engineer and Systems Architect with a strong focus on designing scalable, high-performance systems. My core backend expertise lies in Node.js, Go, and PHP, and I am actively advancing my skills in Java and C# to broaden my architectural capabilities.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-lg">
          As a natural extension of my backend expertise, I have expanded my skill set into AI integration, actively working to embed advanced technologies such as Large Language Models (LLMs) and the Model Context Protocol (MCP) into applications to build intelligent, forward-thinking solutions.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-lg">
          Backed by my proficiency in Google Cloud Platform (GCP), I am dedicated to delivering comprehensive, cloud-native solutions, continuously learning, and solving complex problems with innovative technology.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-2 border-black dark:border-white p-6 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-4">Quick Facts</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 font-body">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-accent font-bold">→</span>
            <span>Based in Tabanan, Bali</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-accent font-bold">→</span>
            <span>Bachelor of Computer Science @ Udayana University</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-accent font-bold">→</span>
            <span>GPA: 3.93/4.0</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-accent font-bold">→</span>
            <span>Bangkit Academy Cloud Computing (Top 10%)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
